00,5267500,NULL,110,5,96364,1360000,'EGP 340,000 · Quarterly',NULL,'تشطيب كامل',NULL,'سولت salt'),(1640,2027,3,2023,'الشيخ زايد',NULL,'شقة',3,'تحت الإنشاء',3614319,3839430,0,157,NULL,48466,1141364,'EGP 285,341 · Quarterly','Unit number: S7-2-2 Second Floor بحري About Sky Ramp Sky Ramp is a one-of-a-kind residential, commercial, and administrative project, built by Upwyde Developments. It covers 10 acres of land in El Sheikh Zayed. It seamlessly blends dynamic architecture, multiple elevations & orientations, and the elegance of modernity. Upwyde Developments constructed the mixed-use buildings of the compound to rise as a beacon of progressive urban living. It also designed a master plan for the project, featuring a wide range of distinguishing facilities. Upwyde included a broad array of premium services in Sky Ramp Zayed Compound to offer its people a seamless experience. It also chose a strategic location in Zayed, one of the most prestigious areas in the West of Cairo. Sky Ramp Sheikh Zayed Master Plan Sprawling across 10 acres of land in El Sheikh Zayed, Sky Ramp Compound is one of the distinguishing projects by Upwyde Developments. The community\'s master plan was flawlessly designed, outlining distinguishing facilities and high-end units. It harmoniously merges residential, commercial, and administrative units. The compound\'s master plan also features a plethora of natural elements. The project is a natural Eden, covered in greenery and lush landscapes. Sky Ramp Sheikh Zayed also exhibits sparkling water features, offering you a refreshing environment. Furthermore, it is a walkable community with jogging and cycling tracks. The lakes and water features of the compound create a tranquil ambience. You can revive and appreciate the natural beauty close to the comfort of your home. Residents can have a nice picnic or grab a cup of coffee and socialize with their neighbours amid its greenery.','على الطوب',NULL,'Skyramp'),(1641,2028,2,2024,'الشيخ زايد',NULL,'شقة',