iterranean Sea. The resort covers a massive land area of 240 acres in Ras El Hekma, North Coast. The project\'s contemporary architecture creates a harmonious natural spectacle in El Sahel, blending in well with the emerald waters and verdant surroundings. With a wide range of world-class amenities, glistening waters, and lush greenery, vacationing in Seashore Hyde Park is truly something else. Seashore Hyde Park Location - Ras El Hekma Seashore Hyde Park is strategically located on a premium spot in Ras El Hekma, exactly on Kilo 207 of the Alexandria - Marsa Matrouh Desert Road, also known as the International Coastal Road. This ideal location in Ras El Hekma puts Seashore: • 3 km for the Fouka Exit • 52 km from Al Dabaa Road • 68 km from Al Alamein Airport • 82 km from Marsa Matrouh Airport • 79 km from Sidi Abdel Rahman • 112 km from Wadi El Natroun Road Seashore Hyde Park Nearby Roads & Resorts Hyde Park Seashore North Coast Resort is easily accessible through the following routes: • Dabaa Road • Wadi El Natroun Road • International Coastal Road Moreover, thanks to its strategic location, Seashore is close to other high-end developments in the area, such as: • Hacienda West • Ogami • Playa • Fouka Bay Seashore Hyde Park Master Plan Hyde Park partnered with the world-renowned architects EDSA and SB to design the Seashore Ras El Hekma master plan. It was meticulously crafted to utilize the resort\'s impressive 240 acres, with wide green spaces and glistening water bodies.','تشطيب كامل',NULL,'Seashore'),(6294,2027,2,2026,'العلمين الجديدة',NULL,'شقة',2,'تحت الإنشاء',1120120,185878,0,145,11,80471,32238,'EGP 32,238 · Monthly','شقه غرفتين بمساحة ١٤٥م في Mazarine Appartment العالمين الجديده الدور الخامس فيو مارينا ٧ و فندق ريكسوس بحري غربي تشطيب كامل تسليم ٩-٢٠٢٧','تشطيب كامل',NULL,'Mazarine Apartment'),(6295,2029,2,2025,'التجمع الخامس',NULL,'شقة',2,'تحت الإنشاء',2616200,1252000,1,112,7,77143,964000,'EGP 241,000 · Quarterly','لافيستا باتيو ڤيدا جروند فلور','نص تشطيب',NU